"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/3808641322","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/15311#issuecomment-3808641322","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15311","id":3808641322,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q87jA0Eq","user":{"login":"Tenderfeel","id":1561936,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjE5MzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1561936?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel","html_url":"https://github.com/Tenderfeel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Tenderfeel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-28T02:45:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-28T02:45:26Z","body":"@florian-lefebvre \nThank you for addressing the bug fix.\nI tried it on the forked CodeSandbox, but the same error appeared and it didn't work.\nThere might be other causes... but I can't figure them out.\n\nhttps://codesandbox.io/p/devbox/astro-actions-test-15313-57p6yv\n\n<img width=\"2194\" height=\"1968\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c18b6219-f28a-456f-9223-880890b5a7b9\" />","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/3808641322/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/3832456114","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/15311#issuecomment-3832456114","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15311","id":3832456114,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q87kbqOy","user":{"login":"Fryuni","id":11063910,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDYzOTEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11063910?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni","html_url":"https://github.com/Fryuni","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Fryuni/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T01:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T01:22:44Z","body":"So, looking into the source code for JSC at the latest version used on iOS 15 we can see that this message correspond to the [error code `InvalidGroupName`](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/4b6f7229ece73498b5f84e7d5aa646c973539053/Source/JavaScriptCore/yarr/YarrErrorCode.cpp#L48)\n\nThat error is set in only one place, [here](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/4b6f7229ece73498b5f84e7d5aa646c973539053/Source/JavaScriptCore/yarr/YarrParser.h#L660). That is on a regex parsing when this construction is found `(?<` without a group identifier immediately after.\n\nOn modern versions there are [two extra checks](https://github.com/WebKit/WebKit/blob/73a97d320d4b5c30e9926e9a521eb0a9caf0baca/Source/JavaScriptCore/yarr/YarrParser.h#L1565-L1576) in case this pattern is not followed by an identifier. It can be followed by `=` for a positive lookbehind or `!` for a negative lookbehind. Any other value would still cause the same error message on modern JSC.\n\nIf I get this right it means that somewhere on the client there is a regex being evaluated with either a positive or a negative lookbehind.\n\nChecking on our own source code, the only place we have a lookbehind is [here](https://github.com/withastro/astro/blob/a29e171bbca984ce80430055dc3657b5d8a2ff32/packages/internal-helpers/src/path.ts#L19). That particular function is not used for anything in the client side and, when built, is not shipped in the client code. BUT, the function `appendForwardSlash` two above it is used for the client code for requesting an action. So, when running the dev server, the function is shipped to the client because the dev server doesn't tree-shake modules, and because this is a parsing error it will break when the module is imported even if nothing calls this function.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/3832456114/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/3833676152","html_url":"https://github.com/withastro/astro/issues/15311#issuecomment-3833676152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/15311","id":3833676152,"node_id":"IC_kwDOFL76Q87kgUF4","user":{"login":"florian-lefebvre","id":69633530,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NjMzNTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69633530?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre","html_url":"https://github.com/florian-lefebvre","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/florian-lefebvre/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-02-02T08:25:27Z","updated_at":"2026-02-02T08:25:27Z","body":"Amazing investigation Luiz thank you! I will send a PR","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/withastro/astro/issues/comments/3833676152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]